00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:57.609
Now, I couldn't believe this was possibly
an actual analysis being made by a real guest

00:00:57.609 --> 00:01:01.789
on Fox News, one of the three major cable
news networks in the United States.

00:01:01.789 --> 00:01:02.789
But it happened.

00:01:02.789 --> 00:01:07.090
Let's jump right in and you will quickly see
that Pat Brosnan appears to have something

00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:08.950
