00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:57.070
The shooter plan to die.

00:01:57.070 --> 00:01:59.750
What does he care if there are police nearby?

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:01.730
And what is Pat Brosnan mean?

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:03.060
Crimes are no longer illegal.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.210
By definition, crimes are illegal acts.

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:09.490
But is he saying we no longer prosecute crimes?

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:10.920
Just from hearing this part?

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.970
It was off to a bad start.

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:16.050
But then he gets into vaccination
Speaker 5: and, you know, how is this is a

